+    - id: amb.2025.k1_collectibles_loss
+      text_at_issue: The 28% Rate Gain Worksheet line 4 asks for "any collectibles gain reported to you on ... Schedule K-1", while
+        the K-1 instructions send box 9b (Form 1065) and box 8b (Form 1120-S) "gain or loss" to line 4.
+      readings:
+        - Enter the K-1 amount on line 4 with its sign (a loss reduces line 7).
+        - Refuse a K-1 collectibles loss.
+      chosen: Enter it with its sign.
+      reason: Both K-1 instructions send the loss to line 4; line 7 combines lines 1 to 6 and floors the result at zero.
